			"name": "Sniper's Eye",
			"reference": "B35",
			"local_notes": "A trained Acute Vision +1 (on top of the Occulobe's Acute Vision 2), kept separate from the organ since this represents marksmanship training rather than physiology.\n\nLore: Scouts serve as a Chapter's snipers and infiltrators long before they're trusted with a Tactical squad's firepower, and that role is trained hard from day one.\n\nDesign: Acute Vision +1 (B35, 2 points/level) representing marksmanship training rather than another organ. 2 points.",
